{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S244-EXERCISE-244XE","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S244-HINT-244XE-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 244Xe","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S244-SEG-244XE","semantic_anchor":"244Xe","source_anchor":"244Xe","source_line_start":1238,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"2ee00464ce96be164a769c772c954656014d0a58f0a35b5da51c317cb3b95c09","source_text":"reduce to the case $u\\ge 0$.   Show that in this case there is for\neach $n\\in\\Bbb N$ a $u_n\\le u$ such that $4^n\\le\\|u_n\\|_p<\\infty$;  take\n$v_n\\in L^q$ such that $\\|v_n\\|_q\\le 2^{-n}$ and\n$\\int u_n\\times v_n\\ge 2^n$, and set $v=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}v_n$.","target_line_start":1270,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"61335eb320e1afee1b30e4022eed491aaab45a1fc442bbf3953f902a5bf898ac","target_text":"reduksikan ke kasus $u\\ge 0$. Tunjukkan bahwa dalam kasus ini,\nuntuk setiap $n\\in\\Bbb N$ terdapat $u_n\\le u$ sedemikian sehingga\n$4^n\\le\\|u_n\\|_p<\\infty$; ambil $v_n\\in L^q$ sedemikian sehingga\n$\\|v_n\\|_q\\le 2^{-n}$ dan $\\int u_n\\times v_n\\ge 2^n$, lalu tetapkan\n$v=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}v_n$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S244"}
